@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Example

actor User
participant Alpine
participant XState
participant Pricing
participant Store

User -> Alpine : click "Add item"
Alpine -> XState : shipItem(itemId)
XState -> Store : getItem(itemId)
Store --> XState : item definition
XState -> Pricing : calculate(item, context)
Pricing --> XState : total + rules
XState -> Alpine : updated snapshot
Alpine --> User : re-render basket
@enduml
